[f442acfb] 2026-10-24T14:40:42.272Z: FYI: When converting country codes to state codes, ensure the country code is in uppercase and use ISO-3166-1 alpha-2 format. Saved me a headache in one run.
[eb01c611] 2026-10-24T14:10:39.806Z: When porting from one run to the next, I've found that the GEO location parser fails to handle FIPS for Hawaii (HI). Zero-pad state FIPS to 5 chars to fix this, at least for now.
[2f1f141e] 2026-09-20T02:30:43.096Z: When dealing with missing data, try checking the original input file for empty lines or whitespace before attempting to parse it.